            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "size": 1076,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Fingerprinting test page</title>\n\n    <script src='./helpers/diff.js' defer></script>\n    <script src='./helpers/constants.js' defer></script>\n    <script src='./helpers/canvas.js' defer></script>\n    <script src='./helpers/tests.js' defer></script>\n    <script src='./main.js' defer></script>\n    <link href='./style.css' rel='stylesheet'></link>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <p><a href=\"../../\">[Home]</a> ↣ <a href=\"../\">[Privacy Protections Tests]</a> ↣ <strong>[Fingerprinting Test Page]</strong></p>\n\n    <p>This page collects various datapoints from your browser that can be used for fingerprinting.</p>\n    <p>⚠️ Please note that: </p>\n    <ul>\n        <li>not all of the properties listed here have to be modified to succesfully prevent fingerprining,</li>\n        <li>depending on the brower some properties may change randomly on every page reload or test run,</li>\n        <li>some data is duplicated, but it's retrieved using different methods,</li>\n        <li>this page has to be loaded over https for all tests to work correctly (some APIs are not available over http).</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p><button id='start'>Start the test</button></p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><input type='checkbox' id='include-all-props'> <label for='include-all-props'>Include all headers and all properties of <code>window</code>, <code>navigator</code> and <code>screen</code> objects</label></li>\n        <li><input type='checkbox' id='include-events'> <label for='include-events'>Collect information from events (you will have to invoke those events)</label></li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <details id='tests' hidden>\n        <summary id='tests-summary'></summary>\n        <ul id='tests-details'>\n        </ul>\n    </details>\n\n    <p><button id='download' disabled>Download the result</button></p>\n    <p><button id='save-to-ls' disabled>Save result in localStorage</button></p>\n    <p><button id='compare-with-ls' disabled>Compare current result with result from localStorage</button></p>\n    <p>Compare current result with result loaded from a file <input type='file' accept='application/json' id='compare-with-file' disabled></p>\n\n    <details id='diff' hidden>\n        <summary id='diff-summary'></summary>\n        <ul id='diff-details'>\n        </ul>\n    </details>\n\n    <details id=\"canvas-check\" hidden>\n        <summary>Canvas visual check</summary>\n    </details>\n    \n</body>\n</html>\n"
